xU2jK8BHdzrJ5gQ3IcHCIIBKBM",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["中山站的超人氣濃厚系牡蠣拉麵，可無限加麵，這次平日中午來剛好不用排隊，點餐機點完直接帶位入座，大概等10分鐘上餐。二屋的品項很簡單，主要就是牡蠣拉麵(有牡蠣)和牡湯拉麵(沒有牡蠣)兩種，就是牛肉麵和牛肉湯麵的概念。\n濃厚牡蠣拉麵($340)真的很濃郁，和東區「魚貝と鶏」的牡蠣雞白湯拉麵都一樣好吃，一上桌就聞到濃郁牡蠣香，湯頭極為厚重，雖濃郁卻順口，完全沒有牡蠣易有的腥味，而且鹹度舒服，整碗喝完也不會口乾。\n配料有五片叉燒和三顆肥厚的牡蠣，煙燻風味的豬叉燒偏瘦，沒有肥滋滋的油脂喧賓奪主，挺好的。三顆牡蠣品質也很好，好吃～\n麵條有兩種，選了較硬的手揉麵再選麵硬，是個人喜歡的硬度，細細卷卷的麵體可以被濃郁的湯汁包覆，又有Q彈勁道，另外要稱讚這個紫洋蔥，居然是甘甜的滋味，完全沒有一絲腥味，真的不錯。\n\n#Lev",null,[0,107]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2779703208744082773/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZFZkVWFETk5NazB3VWpOS2NrOVlhR3haVm5CUVRrVktVRTVyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2779703208744082773/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZFZkVWFETk5NazB3VWpOS2NrOVlhR3haVm5CUVRrVktVRTVyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2779703208744082773/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZFZkVWFETk5NazB3VWpOS2NrOVlhR3haVm5CUVRrVktVRTVyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2779703208744082773/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZFZkVWFETk5NazB3VWpOS2NrOVlhR3haVm5CUVRrVktVRTVyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2779703208744082773/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZFZkVWFETk5NazB3VWpOS2NrOVlhR3haVm5CUVRrVktVRTVyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2779703208744082773/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZFZkVWFETk5NazB3VWpOS2NrOVlhR3haVm5CUVRrVktVRTVyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,3493,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25adVdUaDNNMk0wUjNKck9YaGxZVnBQTkVKUE5rRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbedd7a92320eab89!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnZuWTh3M2M0R3JrOXhlYVpPNEJPNkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUN